    <string name="terminow_sec_title">Security tools</string>
    <string name="terminow_sec_subtitle">Install individual security tools into this Linux environment. Only the tool you choose is installed.</string>
    <string name="terminow_sec_premium_what">install security tools</string>

    <string name="terminow_sec_info_title">Authorized testing only</string>
    <string name="terminow_sec_info_message">These are powerful security tools, provided for authorised testing and education only. Only scan, probe or attack systems you own or have explicit written permission to test. You are responsible for following all applicable laws and policies.\n\nTermiNow installs the exact tool you choose into your Linux environment — it never installs a large metapackage and never runs any scan or attack by itself.</string>

